Changes added by this fork
--------------------------

  index.js                entry point: runs the upstream plugin, then mounts the panel
  index.d.ts              type declarations for the entry point
  panel/codes.mjs         finding normalisation: stable code + fixability + scope
  panel/store.mjs         ladder policy, ignore list, attempt log, handoff dedupe
  panel/jobs.mjs          asynchronous repair jobs (deps/full must not block)
  panel/routes.mjs        HTTP surface under /api/dsh-doctor
  client.js               settings panel (settings.section, id "dsh-doctor")
  icon.svg                panel icon
  NOTICE                  this file
  CHANGELOG.md            fork change log
  DESIGN.md               design document for the panel and repair ladder
  test/smoke.mjs          smoke test for the panel routes (node test/smoke.mjs)

Interaction inspiration
-----------------------

The settings-panel interaction (a status area, a findings list and a fix
ledger) was inspired by fuyu-technology/dsh-auto-repair-ui, which is licensed
under Apache-2.0 and requires attribution notices to be preserved. No source
code from that project is copied or derived here; only the interaction shape
was used as a reference. See DESIGN.md section 10 and README for details.
